# NSO_A2 - HAProxy Load Balancing Environment


## Overview

This project deploys a simple Flask application behind HAProxy using Ansible.

The environment contains:

- One HAProxy server
- Three Flask application servers
- One Bastion host
- One internal site-local network

The deployment is fully automated using Ansible.


## Network Topology


                Internet

                   |
      +------------+------------+
      |                         |
   HTTP:80                  UDP:1611
      |                         |
   HAProxy                    Nginx
      |                         |
      |                      UDP:161
      |
 Flask Load Balance

   +------+------+------+
   |      |      |
  devA   devB   devC

Bastion provides SSH access
to the internal network.



## Network Addressing


### External NAT Network


192.168.122.0/24



| Host | Address |
|-|-|
| Bastion | 192.168.122.20 |
| HAproxy | 192.168.122.21 |


### Site-local Network


10.0.1.0/27



| Host | Address |
|-|-|
| Bastion |10.0.1.5|
| HAproxy |10.0.1.10|
| devA |10.0.1.11|
| devB |10.0.1.12|
| devC |10.0.1.13|



